        "Description": "47.\r\rYou are assigned the following High Value Targets (HVTs) at the town of Sapienza, Italy. Below are the listed targets and the preferred kill methods.\r\rEliminate both Saltatore brothers (Mario and Luigi) with Fibre wire.\rEliminate both Padre Francesco and Stefano Zelaschi with the Church bell.\rUmberto Megazzini: Eliminate with injected lethal poison.\r\rDiscression is of utmost importance when eliminating these HVTs\r\rGood luck!\rReapingZ",
